            right: T(r`$2u-5$ هي $\dv{y}{u}$؛ اضرب في $\dv{u}{x}$.`, r`$2u-5$ is $\dv{y}{u}$; multiply by $\dv{u}{x}$.`), right_latex: r`\dv{y}{x}=(2u-5)\times\dv{u}{x}`,
